    group ungrouped
    topic "removalDescription"
    p "Section 65, act Sept. 3, 5, 1916, ch. 436, § 1, " ["39 Stat. 721" -> "/us/stat/39/721"] ", established eight hour work day for employees of railroads. See " ["section 28301 of Title 49" -> "/us/usc/t49/s28301"] ", Transportation."
