    topic "shortTitle"
    heading "Short Title"
    p "Act Sept. 3, 5, 1916, ch. 436, " ["39 Stat. 721" -> "/us/stat/39/721"] ", which enacted sections 65 and 66 of this title, was popularly known as the “Adamson Law”."
